                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3c578a32-00bd-37fd-b2cc-4cac114c402a",
                        "entry_id": "bd6b09ba-9e1b-388d-8750-b7556bfeb2fa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "etwas, das eine werbende Person, Partei oder Firma einem (möglichen) Wähler oder Kunden zu Werbezwecken zukommen lässt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b2fa224-fe5d-4602-b3b2-dc600e795dbd",
                                "sense_id": "3c578a32-00bd-37fd-b2cc-4cac114c402a",
                                "text": "„Der Kalender neben der Tür war ein Werbegeschenk der Molkerei.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "772b280f-d761-41b1-8d63-a576ad33223b",
                                "sense_id": "3c578a32-00bd-37fd-b2cc-4cac114c402a",
                                "text": "„Der König von Portugal wollte das Nashorn Papst Leo schicken gewissermaßen als Werbegeschenk für die allerkatholischste Absegnung seiner Kolonialpolitik.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "01af74ee-67c3-4f9c-b9f0-9fd33f04aa26",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd6b09ba-9e1b-388d-8750-b7556bfeb2fa",
                        "source_sense_id": "3c578a32-00bd-37fd-b2cc-4cac114c402a",
                        "target_lang_word": "advertising gift",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4f769e77-57c3-46bf-a409-c1fec680a588",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd6b09ba-9e1b-388d-8750-b7556bfeb2fa",
                        "source_sense_id": "3c578a32-00bd-37fd-b2cc-4cac114c402a",
                        "target_lang_word": "promotional gift",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "517a399e-0f15-4b54-98a5-7dacc074b13f",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd6b09ba-9e1b-388d-8750-b7556bfeb2fa",
                        "source_sense_id": "3c578a32-00bd-37fd-b2cc-4cac114c402a",
                        "target_lang_word": "giveaway",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "giveaway",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d0f00be-f90a-38c9-8e56-9271a414a2de",
                                        "entry_id": "4a3a84a7-a4fe-381a-9691-dda0a2dd01cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that is given away or handed out for free."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9532d8f7-5155-47fd-83cc-0304cd619bc9",
                                                "sense_id": "6d0f00be-f90a-38c9-8e56-9271a414a2de",
                                                "text": "The T-shirt was a giveaway from the company that sells the software."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf3d9ea7-403a-4286-9ca8-4bc3a4739aa7",
                                                "sense_id": "6d0f00be-f90a-38c9-8e56-9271a414a2de",
                                                "text": "Then there's ole' reliable: the giveaway. Everyone loves a giveaway (with the notable exceptions of key chains and nail clippers which have been rendered nearly meaningless by repetition)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc33b79b-daaa-459b-90a3-cb29633d826a",
                                                "sense_id": "6d0f00be-f90a-38c9-8e56-9271a414a2de",
                                                "text": "Perhaps the most frequently used giveaway is \"free rent,\" an abatement of rent for a specific period of tenancy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d71d6b29-cbae-4ce0-8064-4e34f592e648",
                                                "sense_id": "6d0f00be-f90a-38c9-8e56-9271a414a2de",
                                                "text": "These giveaway bags cost tens of thousands of dollars, but the sentiment of a thank you for your guests is at the heart of those giveaway bags."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a537581e-2400-38f5-938a-98d0c4233577",
                                        "entry_id": "4a3a84a7-a4fe-381a-9691-dda0a2dd01cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An event at which things are given away for free."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "650d6454-aeff-4f40-90a4-26c9e74d9503",
                                                "sense_id": "a537581e-2400-38f5-938a-98d0c4233577",
                                                "text": "In this giveaway a person who has had something special happen to him gives gifts to others around him, so that they can share in his feelings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cb9c20e-facb-44bf-902f-341eefe69259",
                                                "sense_id": "a537581e-2400-38f5-938a-98d0c4233577",
                                                "text": "His counterpart Tom Wiles also speaks directly for the honored persons in giveaways; in Shannon's outgoing princess giveaway, he addresses a woman named Rose as Shannon gives her a dance shawl: \"Shannon says/ now you can kick up your heels\" (Wiles 1999)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea8f44c7-508e-4e47-b2ca-8c5c79aeb5b5",
                                                "sense_id": "a537581e-2400-38f5-938a-98d0c4233577",
                                                "text": "Following the feast the tables were cleared, making room for the giveaway."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "845fc0e6-d41f-46c3-a163-2e14ac44a90e",
                                                "sense_id": "a537581e-2400-38f5-938a-98d0c4233577",
                                                "text": "This has been such a rewarding exercise for so many of us involved in the giveaway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d22023b-a833-39ba-aaa1-5d43dcf7bead",
                                        "entry_id": "4a3a84a7-a4fe-381a-9691-dda0a2dd01cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of giving something away for free."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b53ed6d7-3968-4f84-a0d4-2df31239b153",
                                                "sense_id": "6d22023b-a833-39ba-aaa1-5d43dcf7bead",
                                                "text": "Nothing kills profits like product giveaway."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "667f3d02-b0ee-43c7-ac49-966543cb8d68",
                                                "sense_id": "6d22023b-a833-39ba-aaa1-5d43dcf7bead",
                                                "text": "Frankly, I think extension of this policy to the nation through the Eisenhower administration policy of 'partnership' with private power monopoly would be the most colossal giveaway in history — 20 or 30 times as big as Teapot Dome or Tideland Oil."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e36a7958-960a-4dc2-ad46-f79023481d3a",
                                                "sense_id": "6d22023b-a833-39ba-aaa1-5d43dcf7bead",
                                                "text": "Late May is the target date for giveaway of the new NPP FloraCopter game by retail Aorists to increase their “in-store traffic\" and sales."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77637f45-96ac-3767-ba37-715cfd6c9e07",
                                        "entry_id": "4a3a84a7-a4fe-381a-9691-dda0a2dd01cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An indicator that makes something obvious or apparent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5719bd86-8f58-4c3c-8b83-f5799fa6047b",
                                                "sense_id": "77637f45-96ac-3767-ba37-715cfd6c9e07",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: clue, sign, tell"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48310836-cbed-429d-814a-e8e34d56fe0d",
                                                "sense_id": "77637f45-96ac-3767-ba37-715cfd6c9e07",
                                                "text": "The frosting in his beard was a giveaway that he had been munching the cake."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ad6e5bb-a2e8-4fb2-ab8c-72ec9bc122b8",
                                                "sense_id": "77637f45-96ac-3767-ba37-715cfd6c9e07",
                                                "text": "Their skin was the real giveaway: again and again it turned out to be fattier and softer than average and therefore warmer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2fc0baa-b3cc-4542-b39c-1ebdfc19a8cb",
                                                "sense_id": "77637f45-96ac-3767-ba37-715cfd6c9e07",
                                                "text": "The real giveaway is its showing time's arrows pointing the wrong way: the universe contracting, or entropy spontaneously decreasing (as in the separation, with no energy input, of brine into fresh water and solid salt)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c92af8b-4c1c-4892-8945-3ee3081cd59f",
                                                "sense_id": "77637f45-96ac-3767-ba37-715cfd6c9e07",
                                                "text": "It was as obvious a giveaway as the deep slash marks across the human part of the torso, shredding the werewolf's clothes and staining the cloth with a deep burgundy of blood."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "906c32c7-ef49-46d7-9804-c6ff3df166d2",
                                                "sense_id": "77637f45-96ac-3767-ba37-715cfd6c9e07",
                                                "text": "Therapeutic zeal is express in a number of ways, some of them quite obvious, others subtle. A therapeutic manner that is too self-assured and controlling is a dead giveaway. Other obvious signs of therapeutic zeal include getting annoyed or openly frustrated with patients who do not change in the way the therapist desires; \"blaming\" the patient by vidictively attributing lack of results to more severe pathology than was intially assumed; or overusing such terms as passive aggressive and poorly motivated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc30acaf-f0ac-40cc-a3d4-1b77e3e46bb4",
                                                "sense_id": "77637f45-96ac-3767-ba37-715cfd6c9e07",
                                                "text": "In my research, I learned that the male had a little differently shaped head but that the real giveaway was that the male would periodically exhibit a bright orange to reddish colored \"dewlap\" extended under its throat while bobbing it's ^([sic]) head as an exhibition of his maleness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "giveaway",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df13f871-8b4b-3745-9b7e-a559f2c2b256",
                                        "entry_id": "3df654e3-2dc8-3ca5-9f16-41831f821bfe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "free of charge, at no cost."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
